This is a '''list of IBF world champions''', showing every world champion recognized by the [[International Boxing Federation]] (IBF). The IBF is one of the four major governing bodies in [[professional boxing]], and has awarded world champions in 17 different [[weight class (boxing)|weight classes]] since 1983.

Boxers who won the title but were stripped due to the title bout being overturned to a [[no contest (combat sports)|no contest]] are not listed.

